{"id":51633,"date":"2026-06-11T15:49:55","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:49:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51633"},"modified":"2026-08-23T21:36:19","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T20:36:19","slug":"corrida-das-trevas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-trevas\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Trevas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">. A 1.\u00aa Corrida das Trevas realiza-se no dia 11 de julho de 2026, e \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Mot\u00f3licos Agilde. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O evento consiste numa corrida de obst\u00e1culos com aproximadamente 10 km de extens\u00e3o e dificuldade m\u00e9dia\/alta.  O percurso ser\u00e1 constitu\u00eddo por trilhos, passagens em \u00e1gua, lama e diversos obst\u00e1culos naturais e artificiais, concebidos para promover a supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica, o esp\u00edrito de aventura<br>e o contacto com a natureza. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Os percursos ser\u00e3o realizados no concelho de Celorico de Basto, essencialmente, Mota, Ferven\u00e7a e Agilde.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\" start=\"2\" >\n<li><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51634,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,519,22],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51633","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-celorico-de-basto-braga","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-obstaculos","event_type-trail","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"ht